    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the underground world of &quot;Nakamers: The Escape,&quot; a platformer game that will take you on a challenging adventure. After a collapse shakes the underground civilization of the D\u00e9kumas, you step into the shoes of Xioon, a daring protagonist in search of his lost family. Explore 8 unique levels, collect mengues, and overcome obstacles to ensure the safety of your loved ones. Nanite and Lumen technology from Unreal Engine 5 implemented.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Exploration and Platforming: Face traps, enemies, and obstacles in underground environments full of challenges. Each level offers a unique experience that will test your platforming skills, with gameplay mixing extremely precise platforming sections and exciting escape moments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Mengue Collection: Collect mengues, the gems representing your lives. Each time you die, you lose one, and if you run out of mengues, your game will be erased regardless of the level you\u2019re on. Every mengue counts!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Hidden Items and Secondary Paths: Meticulously explore each level to find hidden items and secondary paths with additional mengues. Certain hidden items unlock a secondary ending and an extra level. Find them all!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Time Trial Mode: For players seeking an additional challenge, the time trial mode allows you to compete against the clock and hone your skills. Can you beat your own records and those of other players?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Dramatic Story: Immerse yourself in an emotional narrative as you help Xioon overcome adversities and discover the truth behind the collapse. The story will take you on a journey filled with mystery and hope. For players who enjoy the historical context of the D\u00e9kuma, they can take their time in the Maktaba to learn about their castes, gods, customs, and legends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Challenges and Replayability: With a variety of challenges and hidden secrets, &quot;Nakamers: The Escape&quot; will keep you entertained and motivated to improve your skills and uncover everything the underground world has to offer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to face the dangers of the underground and save your family? Join Xioon in &quot;Nakamers: The Escape&quot; and prove your courage and skill in this unforgettable adventure!",
    "about_the_game": "Immerse yourself in the underground world of &quot;Nakamers: The Escape,&quot; a platformer game that will take you on a challenging adventure. After a collapse shakes the underground civilization of the D\u00e9kumas, you step into the shoes of Xioon, a daring protagonist in search of his lost family. Explore 8 unique levels, collect mengues, and overcome obstacles to ensure the safety of your loved ones. Nanite and Lumen technology from Unreal Engine 5 implemented.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Exploration and Platforming: Face traps, enemies, and obstacles in underground environments full of challenges. Each level offers a unique experience that will test your platforming skills, with gameplay mixing extremely precise platforming sections and exciting escape moments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Mengue Collection: Collect mengues, the gems representing your lives. Each time you die, you lose one, and if you run out of mengues, your game will be erased regardless of the level you\u2019re on. Every mengue counts!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Hidden Items and Secondary Paths: Meticulously explore each level to find hidden items and secondary paths with additional mengues. Certain hidden items unlock a secondary ending and an extra level. Find them all!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Time Trial Mode: For players seeking an additional challenge, the time trial mode allows you to compete against the clock and hone your skills. Can you beat your own records and those of other players?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Dramatic Story: Immerse yourself in an emotional narrative as you help Xioon overcome adversities and discover the truth behind the collapse. The story will take you on a journey filled with mystery and hope. For players who enjoy the historical context of the D\u00e9kuma, they can take their time in the Maktaba to learn about their castes, gods, customs, and legends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Challenges and Replayability: With a variety of challenges and hidden secrets, &quot;Nakamers: The Escape&quot; will keep you entertained and motivated to improve your skills and uncover everything the underground world has to offer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to face the dangers of the underground and save your family? Join Xioon in &quot;Nakamers: The Escape&quot; and prove your courage and skill in this unforgettable adventure!",
    "short_description": "Escapa del colapso de una civilizaci\u00f3n que est\u00e1 a punto de extinguirse. Acompa\u00f1a a Xioon en busca de su familia perdida mientras intentas ponerte a salvo de los desprendimientos y sorteando los r\u00edos de lava. Sum\u00e9rgete en una historia \u00e9pica llena de emociones.",
